  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1778789649_2390307_a6841d1682676372c57f0a971cb609e4.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>About Fusion Protein</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">People love the idea of protein. They just don’t love the experience.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Shakes are bulky. Powders are messy. Labels are confusing. And for something people are supposed to take daily, it often feels inconvenient.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We thought protein deserved better.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">So we built a 100ml shot delivering 21g of high-quality whey protein with zero sugar and no prep required. We chose beta-lactoglobulin because it’s a complete protein source with strong bioavailability and a high leucine content. Then we made it taste refreshing.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Because science matters. But so does the experience.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Fusion Protein exists to make functional nutrition more accessible, more transparent, and more realistic for everyday life.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Share Fusion Protein. Get paid for it.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Daily protein, made easy — and a real way to earn while you talk about it.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"font-si